     {
      "id": "8e63970",
      "elType": "widget",
      "widgetType": "text-editor",
      "isInner": false,
      "settings": {
       "editor": "<p>This is my favourite part. Watching a designer hold their sample for the first time.</p><p>We craft your piece with the same care as if it were for our own brand. Then we send it to you. Try it on. Show your mum. Find what's wrong with it (there's always something).</p><p>Then we fix it together. Once, twice, three times if needed. Until you'd wear it to a party and lie when people ask where you bought it.</p><p><strong>What you get:</strong></p><ul><li>A real, wearable sample</li><li>2-3 rounds of tweaks (we're patient)</li><li>That butterflies-in-stomach feeling</li></ul><p><em>*From €depends on the complexity of design so we know how much our pattern maker needs to work. 1-3 weeks. Worth every day.*</em></p>",
       "__globals__": {
        "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text"
       },
